          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "Keyboard dock for apps and modules",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "<p>A dock on the iOS keyboard. Pin <strong>apps</strong>, <strong>editor modules</strong>, groups, and translation presets, then launch or edit without leaving the keyboard.</p><p>Turn it on in <strong>Settings → KBApp</strong>.</p>",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 12
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "Features",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "<ul><li>Launch apps from the keyboard dock</li><li>Groups — one dock icon; tap to open apps and modules inside</li><li>Group templates: Editing Group / Translation Group</li><li>Copy, cut, paste, select all, undo / redo</li><li>Cursor moves, delete, dismiss keyboard</li><li>Translate the selection or the whole field</li><li>Favorite words — insert in one tap</li><li>Clipboard history</li><li>Text labels instead of icons — Settings → Dock → Display Style</li><li>Keyboard click sound — Settings → Features; add your own (1 second or shorter)</li><li>Haptic feedback (off by default) — Settings → Features</li><li>Side inset, spread, spacing, icon size, and distance from the bottom</li><li>Custom / system / keep-image module colors</li></ul>",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
